+\n .qwen/commands/qwen-issue-fixer.toml               |   114 +\n .qwen/commands/qwen-review.toml                    |   172 +\n .qwen/commands/qwen-scheduled-triage.toml          |   115 +\n .qwen/commands/qwen-triage.toml                    |    54 +\n artifacts/d-reader/changed-files.txt               |   536 +\n artifacts/d-reader/product.patch                   |     0\n artifacts/portal-delivery/A01.png                  |   Bin 0 -> 38218 bytes\n artifacts/portal-delivery/C01.png                  |   Bin 0 -> 10402 bytes\n artifacts/portal-delivery/fortune-teller.png       |   Bin 0 -> 1030040 bytes\n artifacts/portal-delivery/portal.png               |   Bin 0 -> 20135 bytes\n artifacts/portal-delivery/results.json             |    36 +\n artifacts/portal-delivery/watch-world.png          |   Bin 0 -> 189661 bytes\n node_modules/.bin/playwright                       |     1 +\n node_modules/.bin/playwright-core                  |     1 +\n node_modules/.package-lock.json                    |    36 +\n node_modules/playwright-core/LICENSE               |   202 +\n node_modules/playwright-core/NOTICE                |     5 +\n node_modules/playwright-core/README.md             |     3 +\n node_modules/playwright-core/ThirdPartyNotices.txt |  1502 ++\n .../playwright-core/bin/install_media_pack.ps1     |     5 +\n .../playwright-core/bin/install_webkit_wsl.ps1     |    35 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_beta_linux.sh             |    42 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_beta_mac.sh               |    13 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_beta_win.ps1              |    24 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_stable_linux.sh           |    42 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_stable_mac.sh             |    12 +\n .../bin/reinstall_chrome_stable_win.ps1            |    24 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_beta_linux.sh             |    48 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_beta_mac.sh               |    11 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_beta_win.ps1              |    23 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_dev_linux.sh              |    48 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_dev_mac.sh                |    11 +\n .../bin/reinstall_msedge_dev_win.ps1               |    23 +\n--- docs\n# C01《陪你读书》核心开发文档\n\n> 状态：IN_PROGRESS / NOT_ACCEPTED。创建于 2026-10-14。本文件是 C01 固定核心入口，不以 PR、聊天或页面说明替代验收。\n\n## 一、产品目标与最简交互\n**书架 → 选择一本书 → 目录／正文 → 🔊 朗读。** 打开即书架，正文是主界面；朗读只需一个喇叭按钮。设置收纳声音、速度、背景音；不把导入、音频 URL、开发状态堆在正文。儿童／长者的可读性、无障碍与操作简洁性应由实测验证。\n\n## 二、REUSE-FIRST 技术路线\n- 阅读内核：foliate-js（上游 https://github.com/johnfactotum/foliate-js，MIT），固定源码版本并保留许可证；依赖 zip.js（BSD-3-Clause）、fflate（MIT）许可证需随发布核对。不得重新发明 EPUB、MOBI、AZW3、FB2、CBZ 解析器。\n- 现有书库：IndexedDB `zero-one-reader-library` / `books`；兼容旧数据，不能无迁移方案修改 schema。\n- TXT：本地纯文本阅读；PDF 优先 PDF.js，但尚未接入。加密 DRM 书籍不承诺支持。DOCX/RTF/HTML/Markdown/CBR 为待评估扩展，不能冒称已支持。\n- 朗读：先复用浏览器 SpeechSynthesis；朗读、暂停、续读、跨章节、声音选择应分别实测。用户授权的个性化声音为独立后续能力。\n- 背景音：人声优先，基础版低音量、可独立控制；按语义／场景动态配乐、片头片尾属于后续模块，须遵守音乐许可并验证听感。\n- 本地优先：书籍和位置本地保存；开源依赖尽量本地固定版本，避免外部 CDN 成为阅读前提。\n\n## 三、当前代码定位\n- 原正式入口：`portal/index.html` → `portal/read-with-you-v01.html`。\n- 新集成分支：`c01-foliate-reader-integration`；草稿 PR #26（https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/pull/26）。\n- 新集成页：`portal/read-with-you-v01.html`；主逻辑：`portal/reader-integrated.js`；开源阅读器：`portal/vendor/foliate-js/`。\n- 测试：`tests/c01-reader/make-books.py`（构造实际 EPUB/TXT）、`tests/c01-reader/check.mjs`（Chromium 导入／目录／正文／朗读接口／进度恢复）；工作流：`.github/workflows/c01-reader-integration.yml`。\n- 既有 `portal/reading-library.html`、`portal/classical-radio.html` 暂保留历史与功能，不作为新阅读主流程的额外必经页面。\n\n## 四、能力状态（不得用“代码存在”代替“通过验收”）\n| 能力 | 当前状态 |\n| --- | --- |\n| foliate-js 源码接入、书架/目录/正文 UI 代码 | 已提交到 PR #26，未合并 |\n| EPUB/TXT 浏览器自动化 | 测试已编写并启动，最终结果需按 Actions 记录核对 |\n| MOBI/AZW3/FB2/CBZ | 已接入解析路径，未完成真实样本逐格式验证 |\n| 连续朗读 | 已接入浏览器 TTS 流程；自动测试使用模拟语音，真实音频长时测试未完成 |\n| 阅读位置恢复 | 已编写保存/恢复逻辑，需核对浏览器测试结果 |\n| PDF、个性化声音、智能配乐 | NOT_IMPLEMENTED |\n| 合并、公开 Pages 发布读回、两轮独立盲测、用户验收 | NOT_DONE |\n\n## 五、发布硬门\n1. 检查源码许可、依赖完整性、安全边界与离线行为。\n2. 使用**实际书籍样本**完成导入、目录、正文、跨章节朗读、暂停续读、关闭重开位置恢复。每个格式单独标记 PASS/FAIL/UNTESTED。\n3. Chromium 自动化不能替代真实设备语音听感与长期连续朗读测试；保留日志、截图、失败案例。\n4. 两轮独立任务盲测、主分支合并、Pages 部署、外部 HTTPS 读回及用户验收均需真实证据。未达门槛不得标 ACCEPTED。\n5. 失败则修复原 PR 与原工单，不另开同质化施工主线。\n\n## 六、任务与追溯\n沿用 #10 RW-00、#11 RW-01（Q博士阅读）、#12 RW-02（D博士语音）、#13 RW-03（C博士集成），以及现有 PR #14；新集成 PR #26 为实施增量，不能抹去旧工作。每次变更记录提交 SHA、测试链接、失败项和下一个验收门。\n\n## 七、更新记录\n- 2026-10-14：首次建立固定核心开发文档，归拢产品形态、技术内核、源文件、任务编号与真实验收边界。创建文档本身不代表功能完成。\n--- testbook\n零一空间·整书朗读测试书\n\n第一章 清晨\n这是项目原创的电子书测试文本。第一章包含三个自然段，用于检查章节解析、语音朗读、暂停和恢复。\n风从窗外吹来。我们在书页里寻找新的问题。\n读到这里，请观察是否能够继续下一段。\n\n第二章 小路\n这是第二章。请检查整书连续朗读是否自动跨过章节边界。\n第二章结束后，重新打开书籍，检查阅读进度是否保留。\n\n第三章 归来\n这是第三章，也是最后一章。这里用于验证整书播放终止时是否正确停止。\n测试文本为项目原创，可用于软件功能测试。\nOutput too long and was saved to: /home/runner/.qwen/tmp/d864d84c12b7ed010721de651f7ede5020f7334fc6244a16975254bc3a4a0aa2/run_shell_command_b6d69b92f770.output"}]}},{"type":"user","uuid":"ca5cf4ce-5f58-4fe8-9513-4a2e5bd51330","session_id":"824540e8-f13e-4561-93d4-f3f912d801e1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_01_unnmoujEDXCM9Z9Rds9H4618","is_error":false,"content":"from pathlib import Path\nfrom zipfile import ZipFile, ZIP_DEFLATED, ZIP_STORED\np=Path('tests/c01-reader/fixtures')\np.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n(p/'real-book.txt').write_text('第一章 早晨\\\\n'+'太阳升起。'*600+'\\\\n第二章 夜晚\\\\n'+'月亮出现。'*600,encoding='utf-8')\nwith ZipFile(p/'real-book.epub','w') as z:\n    z.writestr('mimetype','application/epub+zip',compress_type=ZIP_STORED)\n    z.writestr('META-INF/container.xml','<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><container xmlns=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:container\" version=\"1.0\"><rootfiles><rootfile full-path=\"OEBPS/content.opf\" media-type=\"application/oebps-package+xml\"/></rootfiles></container>')\n    z.writestr('OEBPS/content.opf','''<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<package xmlns=\"http://www.idpf.org/2007/opf\" version=\"3.0\" unique-identifier=\"uid\"><metadata xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"><dc:identifier id=\"uid\">test-book-001</dc:identifier><dc:title>实际章节测试书</dc:title><dc:creator>零一测试作者</dc:creator><dc:language>zh-CN</dc:language></metadata><manifest><item id=\"nav\" href=\"nav.xhtml\" media-type=\"application/xhtml+xml\" properties=\"nav\"/><item id=\"cover\" href=\"cover.svg\" media-type=\"image/svg+xml\" properties=\"cover-image\"/><item id=\"c1\" href=\"c1.xhtml\" media-type=\"application/xhtml+xml\"/><item id=\"c2\" href=\"c2.xhtml\" media-type=\"application/xhtml+xml\"/></manifest><spine><itemref idref=\"c1\"/><itemref idref=\"c2\"/></spine></package>''')\n    z.writestr('OEBPS/cover.svg','''<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 800\"><rect width=\"600\" height=\"800\" fill=\"#315747\"/><rect x=\"35\" y=\"35\" width=\"530\" height=\"730\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2ead7\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#fff9eb\" font-size=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"serif\">实际章节</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"415\" fill=\"#fff9eb\" font-size=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"serif\">测试书</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"660\" fill=\"#e3d8bd\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"serif\">零一测试作者</text></svg>''')\n    z.writestr('OEBPS/nav.xhtml','''<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><title>目录</title></head><body><nav epub:type=\"toc\" xmlns:epub=\"http://www.idpf.org/2007/ops\"><ol><li><a href=\"c1.xhtml\">第一章 早晨</a></li><li><a href=\"c2.xhtml\">第二章 夜晚</a></li></ol></nav></body></html>''')\n    for n,title,body in [(1,'第一章 早晨','太阳升起。'),(2,'第二章 夜晚','月亮出现。')]:\n        z.writestr(f'OEBPS/c{n}.xhtml',f'<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><title>{title}</title></head><body><h1>{title}</h1><p>{body*70}</p></body></html>')\nprint('Created real UTF-8 TXT and valid EPUB with navigation and two chapters')\ncheck.mjs\nmake-books.py\n<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>零一空间｜技术方案与交付看板</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/style.css\"><style>body{background:#f5f7f5;color:#1b3027;font:15px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:22px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(310px,1fr));gap:18px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dce6df;border-radius:14px;padding:20px}.muted{color:#53665b}.warn{color:#88530d}a{color:#245f6d}dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}dd{margin:4px 0 10px}button{padding:8px 13px;background:#264d3c;color:white;border:0;border-radius:8px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:inherit}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{border-bottom:1px solid #dce6df;padding:8px;text-align:left}.small{font-size:13px}</style></head><body><main><p><a href=\"index.html\">← 工作台首页</a></p><h1>技术方案与交付看板</h1><p class=\"muted\">同一页面查看「陪你读书」与「动起来」。候选方案、实际采用、测试、部署、用户验收分开显示；没有正式决定就标注“未确认”，不根据讨论推测。</p><p><button id=\"refresh\">刷新 GitHub 记录</button> <span id=\"updated\" class=\"muted\"></span></p><p id=\"error\" role=\"alert\" style=\"color:#a12c2c\"></p><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"card\"><h2>陪你读书 · C01</h2><dl><dt>负责人</dt><dd>D博士自主技术选型、规划和执行；C博士只负责传递指令及客观核查</dd><dt>最终采用的技术方案</dt><dd id=\"reader-choice\" class=\"warn\">尚未收到D博士正式选型结论</dd><dt>候选参考（不代表采用）</dt><dd>foliate-js、Kokoro、streamtts / Chatterbox、OpenVoice V2、GPT-SoVITS、CosyVoice2，允许D博士自主替换</dd><dt>实际交付</dt><dd class=\"warn\">未完成完整产品验收</dd></dl><p><a href=\"reader-progress.html\">任务进程 →</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/issues/42\">D博士任务及讨论 →</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/blob/main/handoffs/C01-DEEPSEEK-OWNER.md\">授权要求 →</a></p><h3>最近任务动态</h3><div id=\"reader-feed\" class=\"small\">读取中…</div></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>动起来 · V0.2</h2><dl><dt>已知技术资产</dt><dd>MediaPipe 姿态识别原型；openGym 上游 Docker 启动与 CI 工作流已合并，不能等同于部署成功</dd><dt>最终采用的完整技术方案</dt><dd class=\"warn\">尚无经完整运行及验收确认的最终方案</dd><dt>实际交付</dt><dd class=\"warn\">持续运行的完整产品及用户验收尚未确认</dd></dl><p><a href=\"movement-mediapipe.html\">现有试用 →</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/issues/3\">主线任务 →</a> · <a href=\"engineering-console.html\">工程监控 →</a></p><h3>最近施工记录</h3><div id=\"movement-feed\" class=\"small\">读取中…</div></section></div><section class=\"card\"><h2>统一交付门槛</h2><table><thead><tr><th>检查项</th><th>陪你读书</th><th>动起来</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>选型正式记录</td><td>待D博士提交</td><td>待完整方案确认</td></tr><tr><td>可运行产品</td><td>局部原型存在</td><td>局部原型存在</td></tr><tr><td>部署与端到端验证</td><td>待证据</td><td>待证据</td></tr><tr><td>用户最终验收</td><td>未完成</td><td>未完成</td></tr></tbody></table></section></main><script>(()=>{const api='https://api.github.com/repos/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench';const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]));async function get(path){const r=await fetch(api+path,{cache:'no-store',headers:{Accept:'application/vnd.github+json'}});if(!r.ok)throw Error('GitHub HTTP '+r.status+' ('+path+')');return r.json()}async function refresh(){document.getElementById('error').textContent='';try{const [comments,runs]=await Promise.all([get('/issues/42/comments?per_page=50'),get('/actions/runs?per_page=60')]);const rr=runs.workflow_runs||[];const deep=comments.filter(x=>x.user&&x.user.login==='github-actions[bot]');document.getElementById('reader-feed').innerHTML=deep.length?deep.slice(-3).reverse().map(x=>'<p><a href=\"'+esc(x.html_url)+'\">D博士自动调用记录</a> · '+esc(new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString('zh-CN'))+'</p>').join(''):'尚无可核实的D博士自动调用记录';const move=rr.filter(x=>/movement|openGym|upstream|dual-agent|qwen/i.test(x.name||''));document.getElementById('movement-feed').innerHTML=move.length?move.slice(0,5).map(x=>'<p><a href=\"'+esc(x.html_url)+'\">'+esc(x.name)+'</a>：'+esc(x.status==='completed'?x.conclusion:x.status)+'</p>').join(''):'最近60次运行中没有匹配的施工记录';document.getElementById('updated').textContent='读取时间：'+new Date().toLocaleString('zh-CN')}catch(e){document.getElementById('error').textContent='实时数据读取失败：'+e.message+'；不能据此判断任务成功';document.getElementById('reader-feed').textContent='数据不可用';document.getElementById('movement-feed').textContent='数据不可用'}}document.getElementById('refresh').onclick=refresh;refresh()})();</script></body></html>--- pkg?\na01-pr28-regression.yml\nb01-lunar-browser.yml\nc01-reader-integration.yml\nd-reader-autonomous.yml\nd-reader-handoff.yml\nd-reader-independent.yml\ndeepseek-smoke.yml\ndepthmap-prototype.yml\ndq-movement-independent.yml\nmovement-v02-upstream.yml\nportal-delivery.yml\npublish-radio-pages.yml\nqwen-connection-smoke.yml\nrun-k5-advisor.yml\nrun-opensim-m4.yml\nrun-radiance-k3.yml\nthree-doctor-trial.yml\nv02-aider-a01-pilot.yml\nv02-aider-deepseek-a01.yml\nv02-aider-deepseek-b01-round2.yml\nv02-autonomous-developer.yml\nv02-dual-agent-mainline.yml\nv02-dual-track.yml\nv02-pr-browser.yml\nv02-prototype-pipeline.yml\nvendor-human-atlas.yml\nverify-k4-evidence.yml\nverify-public-anatomy.yml\nverify-public-k3.yml\nverify-public-k4.yml\nverify-public-k5.yml\nverify-public-m3.yml\nverify-public-m4.yml\nverify-public-m5.yml\nverify-public-z05-b.yml\nverify-v01-public.yml\nwatch-world-quality.yml"}]}},{"type":"assistant","uuid":"b1ca6423-1a95-4052-ad98-95fb5c3486e9","session_id":"824540e8-f13e-4561-93d4-f3f912d801e1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"b1ca6423-1a95-4052-ad98-95fb5c3486e9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-chat","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_2WMUrNw44KXEzcGdANvM5174","name":"run_shell_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/runner/work/zero-one-workbench/zero-one-workbench && cat deploy/movement-v02/* | head -60 && echo '--- portal index' && cat portal/index.html && echo '--- statusjson' && cat portal/status.json","description":"Inspect deploy config and portal index"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_01_i61ORVvMJ5Vjf8Zmc7DK2147","name":"read_file","input":{"file_path":"/home/runner/work/zero-one-workbench/zero-one-workbench/portal/read-with-you-v01.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":41404,"output_tokens":165,"cache_read_input_tokens":35840,"total_tokens":41569}}},{"type":"user","uuid":"80f85775-012a-47d8-80f7-b19b8b2ddf12","session_id":"824540e8-f13e-4561-93d4-f3f912d801e1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_2WMUrNw44KXEzcGdANvM5174","is_error":false,"content":"# 动起来 V0.2 — 完整成熟系统部署入口\n\n## 当前交付状态\n这是**可执行的完整上游部署入口**，不是已上线的用户原型机。尚未在可公网访问的 HTTPS 主机上完成部署、训练保存/读回及手机端验收，不得标记 V0.2 已交付。\n\n## 原则\n采用 [openGym](https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym) **完整原版**，不复制、删减、改写其动作管理、训练计划、组数记录、历史数据、离线及账号功能。现有 MediaPipe 原型作为独立实验模块保留，不替代完整训练产品。\n\n## 执行\n在有 Docker Compose 的 Linux/macOS 主机：\n```sh\nbash deploy/movement-v02/bootstrap.sh\n```\n脚本会拉取完整上游仓库、创建其 .env、拉取预编译容器、启动完整 web + API，并检测 /api/health。默认本机地址 http://localhost:8080。\n\n公网及手机多设备登录需要 HTTPS 域名，并按照上游 [self-hosting 指南](https://opengym.ch/docs.html) 配置 RP_ID / ORIGIN / 反向代理。不得直接把 localhost 配置作为公网 WebAuthn 服务。\n\n## 版权与数据\nopenGym 应用 AGPL-3.0；其动作媒体图片/GIF 不自动继承代码许可，必须单独核查权利后再对外发布。不要把受限媒体复制进本仓库。持久化数据位于上游实例数据目录，需单独备份。用户测试须检查新增训练、刷新后读取、离线恢复、CSV/备份及手机端。\n\n## 验收门槛\n- [ ] 实际主机完整容器运行，健康检查成功\n- [ ] HTTPS 手机访问、登录及账号恢复\n- [ ] 动作库、训练计划、示范、计时、组数与历史全流程\n- [ ] 关闭重启后数据仍存在；跨设备读回\n- [ ] 许可及媒体资源可发布性核查\n- [ ] 用户实际操作并确认\n\n未通过前只称“部署准备已提交”，不称原型机交付。\n# V0.2 automatic integration gate\n\nThis workflow is a **CI deployment test**, not a public product release.\n\n- Runs every day and on explicit manual dispatch or relevant changes.\n- Retrieves **the full upstream** openGym, checks Docker Compose configuration, starts its full services and calls the API health endpoint.\n- Saves container status/logs and upstream revision as evidence even when checks fail.\n- Opens or comments on an issue for failed runs; does not silently mark a failed task complete.\n- Never copies the upstream exercise media into this repository.\n- Does not claim browser/mobile login, training history persistence or public HTTPS deployment have been verified.\n\n## Production work still required\nProvision an authorized persistent host, configure HTTPS + RP_ID/ORIGIN, backup the data volume, deploy full upstream and test actual exercise creation and persistence across restart. CI ephemeral containers do not meet this gate.\n\n## Security\nNever commit credentials. GitHub Actions token uses read-only content permissions and issue write access solely for failure reporting. Third-party upstream revisions are recorded in artifacts; production upgrades require license/security review and tested rollback.\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n# V0.2: install the unmodified full openGym application, not a stripped-down reimplementation.\nROOT=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nUPSTREAM=\"${OPENGYM_REPO:-https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym.git}\"\nTARGET=\"${OPENGYM_DIR:-$ROOT/opengym-upstream}\"\ncommand -v git >/dev/null || { echo \"git required\" >&2; exit 1; }\ncommand -v docker >/dev/null || { echo \"Docker required\" >&2; exit 1; }\ndocker compose version >/dev/null || { echo \"Docker Compose required\" >&2; exit 1; }\nif [[ ! -d \"$TARGET/.git\" ]]; then\n  git clone \"$UPSTREAM\" \"$TARGET\"\nelse\n  echo \"Existing upstream checkout: $TARGET (not changing revision automatically)\"\nfi\ncd \"$TARGET\"\n--- portal index\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>零一空间｜产品入口</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/style.css\"><style>\nbody{background:#f5f7f5;color:#1c3028}main.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h1{margin-bottom:8px}.intro{color:#52635a;margin-bottom:25px}.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(265px,1fr));gap:16px}.product{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce6df;border-radius:15px;padding:22px}.product h2{margin:0 0 8px}.product p{line-height:1.65}.product a{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-weight:650}.status{font-size:.85rem;color:#735b30}.note{margin-top:26px;color:#52635a;font-size:.95rem}.links{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.links a{font-size:.92rem}\n</style></head>\n<body><main class=\"wrap\">\n<h1>零一空间</h1><p class=\"intro\">从这里进入产品。保留完整目标，优先接入成熟能力，以实际使用和验证结果为准。</p>\n<p><a href=\"tech-delivery-board.html\"><strong>查看「陪你读书」与「动起来」技术方案、执行进程和验收状态 →</strong></a></p>\\n<div class=\"products\">\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>动起来 · 运动达人</h2><p>完整人体与动作、真实动态教学、训练跟练、记录和反馈；面向不同年龄、场地和身体条件。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：MediaPipe 运行时与姿态模型已改为本站同源部署；真实设备跟练和用户验收仍待完成。</p><a href=\"movement-mediapipe.html\">打开摄像头跟练原型 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>算命先生 · 天机完整原版</h2><p>完整复用 MIT 开源的“天机”Web 产品，保留原版八字、六爻、紫微斗数、中英双语、主题切换与分享功能；所有计算在浏览器本机完成。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：天机完整原版已合并至主分支，可作为局部试用入口；算命先生要求的其他成熟系统尚未完整接入，整体产品未验收。</p><a href=\"fortune-teller/index.html\">打开算命先生 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>零一空间研究 · 陪你读书</h2><p>整书阅读与聆听、目录、进度、笔记交流、背景音及经授权的个性化声音。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：已接入 Foliate 整书阅读器与封面书架，支持本地导入、目录、连续朗读和背景音；个性化声音训练与用户验收尚未完成。</p><a href=\"reader-integrated.html\">打开陪你读书 →</a> · <a href=\"reader-progress.html\">查看任务明细与进程 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>听世界 · 网络电台</h2><p>选择音乐和广播频道，边听边做自己的事。</p><a href=\"classical-radio.html\">打开听世界 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>看世界 · 直播频道</h2><p>世界直播、城市、自然、太空、音乐与文化视频。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：直播目录已有经媒体探测的频道；浏览器实际播放与公开交付仍待验证。</p><a href=\"watch-world.html\">查看看世界 →</a></article>\n</div>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>统一试用与反馈：</strong>各入口均可直接打开；页面可访问不代表功能已通过实测。请记录具体操作、错误原文及浏览器环境，反馈后修复并重新发布。<br><strong>交付标准：</strong>可实际操作、成熟组件真实运行、许可可核查、部署可访问、测试可复现。试用发布与最终用户验收分别记录。未完成的功能不写成已上线。</p>\n<nav class=\"links\" aria-label=\"工程资料\"><a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/issues/24\">原施工单</a><a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/actions\">自动化记录</a><a href=\"v02-control.html\">历史施工记录</a><a href=\"engineering-console.html\">工程日志</a></nav>\n</main></body></html>\n--- statusjson\n{\n  \"updated\": \"2026-09-27 14:50 UTC+08:00\",\n  \"policy\": \"Drive authoritative -> Drive readback -> GitHub CURRENT sync -> GitHub readback\",\n  \"projects\": {\n    \"research\": {\n      \"name\": \"零一空间研究\",\n      \"closed_mainline\": {\n        \"id\": \"Z01-Z04\",\n        \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n        \"passed\": 4,\n        \"total\": 4\n      },\n      \"current_mainline\": {\n        \"id\": \"K02-03\",\n        \"title\": \"术数/方技案例的可验证性与失效机制\",\n        \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"total\": 5,\n        \"published_at\": \"2026-09-27 14:48 UTC+08:00\",\n        \"cases\": [\n          \"贺良\",\n          \"少翁\",\n          \"栾大\",\n          \"尹敏\",\n          \"任文公\"\n        ],\n        \"next\": \"贺良原典定位与五维试填\"\n      },\n      \"active_sublines\": [\n        \"TEMP-E01\",\n        \"TEMP-M01\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"movement\": {\n      \"name\": \"动起来\",\n      \"mainline\": {\n        \"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\",\n        \"passed\": 1,\n        \"total\": 4\n      },\n      \"M01\": {\n        \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n        \"evidence\": \"9/9 SHA-256; 5/5 ZIP; 112/112 members audited\"\n      },\n      \"M02\": {\n        \"status\": \"PAUSED_PENDING_C_ACCEPTANCE\",\n        \"last_substantive_action\": \"2026-09-27 13:36 UTC+08:00\",\n        \"evidence\": \"Q clean-blind first pass submitted\"\n      },\n      \"M03\": {\n        \"status\": \"BLOCKED_CLEAN_CONTEXT\",\n        \"reason\": \"current context has seen Q summary\"\n      },\n      \"M04\": {\n        \"status\": \"BLOCKED_BY_M03_AND_C_ACCEPTANCE\",\n        \"results\": \"not formed\"\n      },\n      \"coordinate_system\": \"ACTIVE; complete biceps-elbow-forearm sample not field-calibrated\",\n      \"youth\": \"ACTIVE_V0.1_ARTIFACT_EXISTS\",\n      \"community_grading\": \"RESTART_NOW\"\n    },\n    \"food\": {\n      \"name\": \"食色性也\",\n      \"status\": \"P