n\n**Why:** the user set repository-safety boundaries (no unlicensed books/music/voices, no cloning without authorization) and forbade silently trimming the vision; C博士's protocol does not govern D博士.\n\n**How to apply:** before adding a feature ask which rule it touches; state remaining trade-offs in the final report to the user, not to C博士.\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_01_i6V9OqDEV8oeHcjnKiyu0006","name":"write_file","input":{"file_path":"/home/runner/.qwen/memories/feedback/interaction-mode.md","content":"---\nname: Non-interactive runs need assumption-and-proceed\ndescription: In this environment runs are single-turn and headless; never ask the user questions — make safe assumptions, or report a blocker as the final result\ntype: feedback\ncategory: communication_preference\nkeywords:\n  - \"non-interactive single turn run\"\n  - \"never ask user question\"\n  - \"report blocker as final result\"\nusage_scenarios:\n  - \"Working through a long implementation task headlessly\"\n  - \"Facing ambiguity mid-task\"\n---\n\nThe user runs the CLI non-interactively (headless, single turn, no reply possible after the response).\n\n**Why:** stated in the task prompt; asking a question wastes the whole turn.\n\n**How to apply:** pick the reasonable default, keep going, and list genuine unresolved trade-offs/blockers at the end of the final report.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":77474,"output_tokens":661,"cache_read_input_tokens":76288,"total_tokens":78135}}},{"type":"user","uuid":"385d6f34-4de8-473c-80ed-f24a2a9771f1","session_id":"824540e8-f13e-4561-93d4-f3f912d801e1","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_KlmIpNY3oZxz5AVsG1Wo6726","is_error":false,"content":"Successfully created and wrote to new file: /home/runner/.qwen/projects/-home-runner-work-zero-one-workbench-zero-one-workbench/memory/project/product-principles.md."}]}},{"type":"user","uuid":"6669735d-133b-43fb-b540-51